{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How hard can it be to retire on a dying planet? The future has been torn to shreds by those who hold it in their hydraulic claws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scropia is a story-driven visual novel set on a planet colonized by mechanical life forms, featuring mini-games. This civilization, which briefly introduces itself as the Federation and rules nearly the entire planet with an iron fist, is rapidly approaching its end due to never-ending wars with biological life forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scropia's story begins when the bot named Mether wakes up while being transported to a place called \u201cparadise\u201d for retirees via a kind of cable car line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Translated with  (free version)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036720?t=1760289196","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036720/fff117cb1f201f889c12f1bcba6cfe01ad7b8ae4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760289196","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036720/8b7c359ccb9d49690754c7083bc2830b02ba199d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760289196","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036720/8b7c359ccb9d49690754c7083bc2830b02ba199d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760289196","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How hard can it be to retire on a dying planet? The future has been torn to shre